## Why This Is Asked

This question assesses practical understanding of retrieval pipelines using chunking, embeddings, and vector stores, along with knowledge of real-world metrics for evaluating RAG systems.

## Key Concepts

- Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)
- Document chunking strategies (size, overlap, and trade-offs)
- Embedding models and vector stores
- Two-stage retrieval (dense retrieval + reranking)
- Evaluation metrics: recall@K and latency benchmarks

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal chunking sketch (size=512, overlap=128)
function chunkText(text, size = 512, overlap = 128) {
  const chunks = [];
  let start = 0;
  while (start < text.length) {
    const end = start + size;
    chunks.push(text.slice(start, end));
    start += size - overlap;
  }
  return chunks;
}

// Two-step retrieval call
async function retrieve(query, topK = 10) {
  const queryEmbedding = await embedModel.embed(query);
  const initialResults = await vectorStore.search(queryEmbedding, topK * 3);
  const reranked = await reranker.rerank(query, initialResults, topK);
  return reranked;
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests system design skills for production AI systems, understanding of trade-offs between accuracy and latency, and knowledge of evaluation metrics in real-world scenarios.

## Expected Answer
Strong candidates will discuss: 1) Multi-stage evaluation architecture, 2) Confidence threshold tuning, 3) Fallback strategies, 4) Monitoring and alerting, 5) Cost optimization through early filtering.

## Code Example
```typescript
class HallucinationDetector {
  async evaluate(response: string, context: string) {
    const semanticScore = await this.semanticCheck(response, context);
    if (semanticScore > 0.9) return { confident: true, score: semanticScore };

    const factualScore = await this.factualVerification(response);
    const ensembleScore = this.ensembleWeighting(semanticScore, factualScore);

    return {
      confident: ensembleScore > 0.85,
      score: ensembleScore,
      needsReview: ensembleScore < 0.7
    };
  }
}
```

